 "remarks": "Imagine a home that feels like a permanent vacation, where crisp coastal aesthetics meet effortless everyday living. Tucked away on a quiet and close to town street, 9 Old Stone Road is a masterclass in airy sophistication, blending a light-drenched palette with a warm, lived-in soul.  From the moment you step through the door, the home breathes. Natural light pours across thoughtfully updated finishes, creating a bright, breezy flow. The heart of the home is a stunning white kitchen featuring high-end appliances and sleek surfaces that make every morning feel special. It opens seamlessly into a breathtaking living space where soaring ceilings add grand scale while keeping the vibe relaxed and inviting. When the weather is too good to stay inside, the oversized deck and yard offers a massive footprint for outdoor dining and lounging under the stars.  The second floor is designed for both beauty and practicality. Retreat to a primary suite that defines \"sanctuary,\" complete with a spa-inspired bath and a beyond impressive closet. This level also features three additional bedrooms, another full bath, and a dedicated large laundry room. With a two-car attached garage and plenty of storage, everything has its place. 9 Old Stone Road offers a polished, turnkey lifestyle in a location that truly has it all. Come experience this coastal-inspired gem for yourself. Walk to train and the wonderful new Corbin District in downtown Darien!",
